    <h2 class="visually-hidden">Announcement Message</h2>
    

            <div class="field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p><em>Originally posted on Jan. 29, 2026:</em></p><p>On Jan. 27, 2026, the SF Board of Education approved the academic calendars for the 2026–27 and 2027–28 school years. The calendars are shared below in the district's major languages:&nbsp;</p><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>2026-27</strong></td><td><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1p4nSZGsIeP2dyLOslIu503s8QnmY6nlw/view?usp=drive_link" data-entity-type="external">English&nbsp;</a></td><td><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QSEEbPEi7ZGW-6lLMGuyVBnyaCn8TxIW/view?usp=drive_link" data-entity-type="external">Español</a>&nbsp;</td><td><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/17yqUCnoRBm2YwpZC-q6oskWxkMEjTeG7/view?usp=drive_link" data-entity-type="external">中文</a></td><td><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1y5_bitMtkGjewEeAlMi6RdDHDrYJolif/view?usp=drive_link" data-entity-type="external">عربي</a></td><td><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1RmNz7Lh0PF4JqjMyddUlpUVoCuH0PnDS/view?usp=drive_link" data-entity-type="external">Tiếng Việt</a></td><td><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zuzHxiXzF3YN5S-rxci8E_5k_WUsm1Dp/view?usp=drive_link" data-entity-type="external">Tagalog</a></td><td><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1afMR4NguUDsIMaC9S_Pgf697DfcwNQgs/view?usp=drive_link" data-entity-type="external">Gagana Sāmoa</a></td></tr><tr><td><strong>2027-28</strong></td><td><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1x-ijjIDs9h6BqIqqYWbmQx_aiyEQwdGr/view?usp=drive_link" data-entity-type="external">English</a></td><td><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ugLhXuA9nADOLpZKebkBDjM_FSr_4lEL/view?usp=drive_link" data-entity-type="external">Español</a></td><td><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1r_KAMZmtQusUi9cSNlNlUNd5LRFrFwXl/view?usp=drive_link" data-entity-type="external">中文</a></td><td><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1OZxenNU8Ci0yU5KR-2392s33RW5QpVC6/view?usp=drive_link" dat