    <div id="block-studentfamilyschoolresourcelink" class="block block-block-content block-block-contentd248dc8d-e653-4e32-80a0-9b431035de6d">
  
      <h2>Student Family School Resource Link</h2>
    
      

            <div class="field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p>SFUSD's<a href="https://www.sfusd.edu/services/family-supports-services/sfusd-student-family-school-resource-link"> Student Family School Resource Link</a> supports students and families in navigating all of the SFUSD resources available to them. Students and families can email requests to&nbsp;<a href="mailto:sflink@sfusd.edu">sflink@sfusd.edu</a>, call 415-340-1716 (M-F, 9 a.m. to noon and 1 to 3 p.m., closed from 12 to 1 p.m. every day and on&nbsp;<a href="https://www.sfusd.edu/calendars">school holidays</a>), or complete an&nbsp;<a href="https://familylink.sfusd.edu/">online request form</a>.&nbsp; Staff who need technology support should contact the Technology Help Desk (<a href="mailto:help@sfusd.edu">help@sfusd.edu</a>, 415-241-6476), while staff who need Human Resources support can find guidance about routing their requests on&nbsp;<a href="https://www.sfusd.edu/employees/human-resources-0?search_api_fulltext=contact%20human%20resources">HR’s homepage</a>.</p></div>
      

  </div>
<div id="block-athleticsparticipationdata" class="block block-block-content block-block-contentc6705d01-1fc8-49f3-b86c-010cba4770c1">
  
      <h2>Athletics Participation Data</h2>
    
      

            <div class="field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p>View SFUSD's athletics participation data&nbsp;for&nbsp;<a href="https://public.tableau.com/app/profile/san.francisco.unified.school.district/viz/SFUSDAthleticsParticipation2024-25/Story1" data-entity-type="external">2024-25</a>, <a href="https://public.tableau.com/app/profile/san.francisco.unified.school.district/viz/SFUSDAthleticsParticipation2023-24/Story1">2023-24</a> ,<a href="https://public.tableau.com/app/profile/san.francisco.unified.school.district/viz/SFUSDAthleticsParticipation2022-23/Story1?publish=yes">2022-23</a>,&nbsp;<a href="https://public.tableau.com/app/profile/san.francisco.unified.school.district/viz/shared/ZYT5F8DT5">2021-22</a>, or&nbsp;<a href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1HT4nJ3X4yTegX9dCOjUOC2QcUBnq84BF?usp=sharing">2015-16 through 2019-20</a>.</p></div>
      

